---@field enableBranchAutoDeletion? aws.amplify.EnableBranchAutoDeletion Automatically disconnects a branch in the Amplify console when you delete a branch from your Git repository.
---@field enableBasicAuth? aws.amplify.EnableBasicAuth Enables basic authorization for an Amplify app.
---@field basicAuthCredentials? aws.amplify.BasicAuthCredentials|distilled.Secret The basic authorization credentials for an Amplify app. You must base64-encode the authorization credentials and provide them in the format user:password.
---@field customRules? aws.amplify.CustomRules The custom redirect and rewrite rules for an Amplify app.
---@field buildSpec? aws.amplify.BuildSpec|distilled.Secret The build specification (build spec) for an Amplify app.
---@field customHeaders? aws.amplify.CustomHeaders The custom HTTP headers for an Amplify app.
