---@field autoBranchCreationConfig? aws.amplify.AutoBranchCreationConfig The automated branch creation configuration for an Amplify app.
---@field repository? aws.amplify.Repository The name of the Git repository for an Amplify app.
---@field oauthToken? aws.amplify.OauthToken|distilled.Secret The OAuth token for a third-party source control system for an Amplify app. The OAuth token is used to create a webhook and a read-only deploy key using SSH cloning. The OAuth token is not stored.
---@field accessToken? aws.amplify.AccessToken|distilled.Secret The personal access token for a GitHub repository for an Amplify app. The personal access token is used to authorize access to a GitHub repository using the Amplify GitHub App. The token is not stored.
---@field jobConfig? aws.amplify.JobConfig Describes the configuration details that apply to the jobs for an Amplify app.
---@field cacheConfig? aws.amplify.CacheConfig The cache configuration for the Amplify app.

